{
    "title": "Makeover Pin: Makeup & Fashion",
    "description": "Makeover Pin: Makeup & Fashion is a story of a poor girl who is kicked out of the house by a cheating boyfriend. You need to help her with the makeovers by pulling the pin. No more fake ads, this is the game you are looking for!\r\n\r\nGive desperately needed makeovers to help the girl achieve her dreams! Choose highly fashionable clothes, hairstyles, makeup, and even furniture! Pull the pin! Play challenging fashion-themed puzzles to help find that perfect look! And don't forget to help her prepare for the dating. Her clothes, hairstyles and makeup will determine which boy she will be dating.\r\n\r\nPULL THE PIN to SOLVE addictive puzzles\r\n\r\nCHOOSE from lots of fashionable clothes to create the perfect look!\r\n\r\nMAKEOVER the poor girl and give her the confidence to follow her dreams!\r\n\r\nDECORATE a girl\u2019s dream room as well as her appearance!\r\n\r\nDRAMA is everywhere, be ready to meet some extreme personalities!\r\n\r\nMakeover Pin: Makeup & Fashion is the trending pull the pin puzzle game with an amazing storyline. Download today to receive a limited gift \r\n\r\nHaving a problem ? Don't worry. Contact us via email: help@gameestudio.com\r\nVisit our Facebook fanpage: https://www.facebook.com/gameeglobal",
